From 91299626175d050a8ebc5cb35c1235492043cf92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cizar-szymon <szymon@cs-lab.eu>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:24:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 0.120: boxes keep their clicks, no box left under the map at
 a game change, one click joins a road, dead trees option

- Interface::set_game closes the box and the message of the old game (they stayed open unseen under the new map view; the double clicks of Fast building and Fast mapclick did nothing).
- GuiObject::opaque: boxes, the panel, the message and the LAN chat keep a click or double click they do not use (it went on to the map under them).
- A normal click joins an existing road where a flag may stand; the double click right after it does not begin a new road.
- Dead trees on new maps (Video, 0-100 %), sent in the LAN setup (version 5).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J7U35RuKvTQMs84jNJEFhT
